          {
            "id": "s1:p2",
            "text": "Onopordum nervosum, called Moor's cotton thistle or reticulate thistle, is a species of flowering plant in the genus Onopordum native to the Iberian Peninsula. It has gained the Royal Horticultural Society's Award of Garden Merit."
          },
          {
